<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1358393929"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1457506232"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Tornado"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Trivecta / Monika Santucci"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Tornado"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:09.789"><div begin="00:12.244" end="02:50.395"><p begin="00:12.244" end="00:13.324" itunes:key="L1">Just to think<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是回想</span></p><p begin="00:13.324" end="00:16.598" itunes:key="L2">Yesterday you were mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">昨日</span></p><p begin="00:16.598" end="00:17.689" itunes:key="L3">And I was yours<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们彼此拥有</span></p><p begin="00:18.792" end="00:19.895" itunes:key="L4">I would wait<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我耐心等待</span></p><p begin="00:19.895" end="00:20.986" itunes:key="L5">Just to be<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为了</span></p><p begin="00:20.986" end="00:24.272" itunes:key="L6">Wound up in your arms<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">兴奋地躲到你的臂弯里</span></p><p begin="00:24.272" end="00:26.455" itunes:key="L7">Time will tell us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间会告诉我们答案</span></p><p begin="00:26.455" end="00:28.649" itunes:key="L8">Just where we go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们去往的方向</span></p><p begin="00:29.113" end="00:35.673" itunes:key="L9">Always stuck inside your tornado<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄然陷入你制造的龙卷风</span></p><p begin="00:37.856" end="00:40.050" itunes:key="L10">'Cause I'm waiting out the storm<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只需静静等待暴风雨结束</span></p><p begin="00:40.050" end="00:42.244" itunes:key="L11">Before I up and go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我起身离开之前</span></p><p begin="00:43.336" end="00:45.530" itunes:key="L12">I see beneath your scars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看到你身上的疤痕</span></p><p begin="00:45.530" end="00:48.816" itunes:key="L13">I'd never lose hope<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我永远都不会失去希望</span></p><p begin="00:48.816" end="00:50.987" itunes:key="L14">Oh, I'm waiting out the storm<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喔 我默默等待暴风雨结束</span></p><p begin="00:52.078" end="00:54.272" itunes:key="L15">I hear the thunder roll<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我听到雷声隆隆</span></p><p begin="00:54.272" end="00:57.546" itunes:key="L16">But it's tearing me apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但这轰鸣声几乎将我摧毁</span></p><p begin="00:57.546" end="00:59.729" itunes:key="L17">Like a tornado<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像龙卷风肆虐而过</span></p><p begin="01:03.015" end="01:06.289" itunes:key="L18">Like a tornado<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像龙卷风肆虐而过</span></p><p begin="01:08.413" end="01:11.699" itunes:key="L19">Like a tornado<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像龙卷风肆虐而过</span></p><p begin="01:16.786" end="01:17.632" itunes:key="L20">(Ah-ah-ah)</p><p begin="01:21.997" end="01:24.180" itunes:key="L21">(Go)</p><p begin="01:27.454" end="01:29.648" itunes:key="L22">(Go-oh-oh)</p><p begin="01:34.025" end="01:36.208" itunes:key="L23">Every time we rewind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次</span></p><p begin="01:36.208" end="01:38.390" itunes:key="L24">To the way we were before<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们回到</span></p><p begin="01:39.482" end="01:41.664" itunes:key="L25">Waking up, still stuck<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">醒来时刻</span></p><p begin="01:41.664" end="01:44.903" itunes:key="L26">In the endless back and forth<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍停滞不前</span></p><p begin="01:44.903" end="01:47.086" itunes:key="L27">Time will tell us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间会告诉我们答案</span></p><p begin="01:48.189" end="01:50.372" itunes:key="L28">Just where we go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们去往的方向</span></p><p begin="01:50.372" end="01:56.908" itunes:key="L29">Always stuck inside your tornado<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄然陷入你制造的龙卷风</span></p><p begin="01:57.988" end="02:01.262" itunes:key="L30">'Cause I'm waiting out the storm<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只需静静等待暴风雨结束</span></p><p begin="02:01.262" end="02:03.445" itunes:key="L31">Before I up and go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我起身离开之前</span></p><p begin="02:03.445" end="02:06.730" itunes:key="L32">I see beneath your scars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看到你身上的疤痕</span></p><p begin="02:06.730" end="02:10.016" itunes:key="L33">I'd never lose hope<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我永远都不会失去希望</span></p><p begin="02:10.016" end="02:12.198" itunes:key="L34">Oh, I'm waiting out the storm<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喔 我默默等待暴风雨结束</span></p><p begin="02:12.198" end="02:15.472" itunes:key="L35">I hear the thunder roll<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我听到雷声隆隆</span></p><p begin="02:15.472" end="02:17.655" itunes:key="L36">But it's tearing me apart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但这轰鸣声几乎将我摧毁</span></p><p begin="02:18.746" end="02:20.929" itunes:key="L37">Like a tornado<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像龙卷风肆虐而过</span></p><p begin="02:24.203" end="02:26.397" itunes:key="L38">Like a tornado<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像龙卷风肆虐而过</span></p><p begin="02:29.695" end="02:31.866" itunes:key="L39">Like a tornado<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像龙卷风肆虐而过</span></p><p begin="02:37.276" end="02:38.356" itunes:key="L40">(Ah-ah-ah)</p><p begin="02:42.733" end="02:44.915" itunes:key="L41">(Go)</p><p begin="02:48.201" end="02:50.395" itunes:key="L42">(Go-oh-oh)</p></div></body></tt>